1JUL2024 @hanoihantrakul
I consulted with Li Tang in JUN2024 on what tokenizer setup 
the TTS was using. I learned they have their own implementation
of ROPE embedding, which is not the same as the MK2 implementation
used by default in BigMusic Tokenizer and is also not the same as 
the MK4 implementation which is supposed to be the same as the paper.

In this set of configs, I use the exact same setting as TTS. There
are additional tricks they use including
- GELU activation
- self.audio_encoder is also a conformer. In default BigMusic tokenizer
self.audio_encoder is actually a Conv2D with Subsampling strides. 